Assessment: Circuit analysis problems + Ohm's law applications

WEEK 28: Module 11 Magnetism - Magnetic Fields & Induction

Session 28A (1.5 hrs): Magnetism & Electromagnetic Induction
• Magnetic field properties (45 min)
• Electromagnetic induction principles (30 min)
• Generator and motor principles (15 min)

Session 28B (1.5 hrs): Magnetism Lab
• Experiment 11.2: Magnetic field mapping
• Experiment 11.2.1: Electromagnetic induction
• Motor and generator construction

Assessment: Electromagnetic problems + induction analysis

WEEK 29: Module 11 & 12 Integration - EM Applications to Earth Science

Session 29A (1.5 hrs): EM Applications & Earth Science Preview
• Electromagnetic applications (45 min)
• Introduction to Earth's structure (45 min)

Session 29B (1.5 hrs): EM Applications Lab
• Experiment 11.3: Electromagnetic applications
• Experiment 11.4: Advanced EM investigations
• Earth science preparation

Assessment: Module 11 Quiz + EM applications project

WEEK 30: Module 12 & 13 Earth Science - Earth Systems

Session 30A (1.5 hrs): Earth's Interior & Atmospheric Systems
• Plate tectonics and Earth's structure (45 min)
