Assessment: Earth science comprehensive project + lab analysis

WEEK 31: Module 14 & 15 Life Sciences & Research - Applications & Methodology

Session 31A (1.5 hrs): Biochemistry Applications & Research Methods
• Chemistry and physics in biological systems (45 min)
