• Data analysis and presentation prep

Assessment: Research proposal + Module 14 & 15 Quizzes

WEEK 32: Module 15a & Final Assessment - AI Ethics & Course Synthesis

Session 32A (1.5 hrs): AI Ethics in Science & Course Reflection
• Safe and ethical use of AI in education (45 min)
